</span>,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 157</span> (<span class=\"ital\">var.</span> <span class=\"grec\"><span data-linked-entries=\"chraomai,chrauô\">χρᾶσθαι</span></span>). <span class=\"ital\">Impf. 3 pl.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\"><span data-linked-self data-linked-alternatives=\"chraomai,chraô\">ἐχρέοντο</span>,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">4, 157,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span>\n(<span class=\"ital\">var.</span> <span class=\"grec\"><a href=\"/chraomai\">ἐχρέωντο</a></span>). <span class=\"ital\">Les contract. de\n<span class=\"grec\">αε</span> se font chez les Att. en</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">η</span> : <span class=\"grec\"><span data-linked-self data-linked-alternatives=\"chraomai,chrauô,chraô,chrês\">χρῇς</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Aj.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">1373 ;</span> <span class=\"grec\"><span data-linked-self data-linked-alternatives=\"chraomai,chrauô,chraô,chrê_(1),chrê_(2)\">χρῇ</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">El.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">35,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">chez les Ion. en</span> <span class=\"grec\">ᾱ</span> : <span class=\"grec\"><span data-linked-self data-linked-alternatives=\"chraomai,chrauô,chraô\">χρᾷς</span>,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">4, 155 ;</span> <span class=\"grec\"><span data-linked-self data-linked-alternatives=\"chra,chraomai,chrauô,chraô\">χρᾷ</span>,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 55 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">inf.</span> <span class=\"grec\"><span data-linked-self data-linked-alternatives=\"chran,chraomai,chrauô,chraô\">χρᾶν</span>,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">8, 135</span>.</div>\n<div class=\"etymrev\"><span class=\"etiqetymrev\">Étym.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\"><a href=\"/chrê_(1)\">χρή</a></span> ; <sp